+| streak | runs | exit code | window |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| old | #285, #290, #300, #305, #307, #309 | **1** | 10-24/25 (BEFORE c161014) |
+| current | #327, #328, #329 | **2** | 10-29 (after c161014) |
+
+Exit 1 = BridgeError escaping `main()` (queue fetch / labels / sync fetch — the
