+## 3. Exit-code semantics (private `scripts/bridge/bridge_intake.py`, read via tower)
+
+- L962 `return 2 if unexpected else 0` — any per-order result line containing
+  ERROR/UNEXPECTED without QUARANTINED fails the whole run.
+- L1078-1081 — `sync_errors` → 2. L1083-1090 — missing BRIDGE_TOKEN / unknown mode → 2.
+- `main()`: `if rc == 0 … cmd_sync(token)` — **sync (landed/rejected reporting) is
